# Operations Rules

- All workflows run on `ubuntu-latest`; concurrency groups use `github.ref` only (no null PR numbers).
- `migrate` service is a one-time deploy job with `required: true` on backend depends_on.
- Frontend reproducible builds via `npm ci` + `package-lock.json`.
- Dockerfile installs deps to shared `/opt/appdeps` prefix with `--chown=app:app`.
- Non-root `app` user in backend and frontend runtime images.
- `/metrics` protected by bearer token auth.
- Release sequence: Plan → Validate → Build → Test → Security → Artifact → Approval → Deploy → Smoke → Observe → Release/rollback.
- Do not force-push by default; never rewrite shared history without authorization.
